hotspots","Área quemada × focos","Surface brûlée × points chauds","Area terbakar × hotspot","烧毁面积 × 火点"],"Linha":["Line","Línea","Ligne","Garis","折线"],"Cobertura queimada":["Burned cover","Cobertura quemada","Couverture brûlée","Tutupan lahan terbakar","烧毁覆盖类型"],"Fonte: MCD64A1 por cobertura do solo, GWIS.":["Source: MCD64A1 by land cover, GWIS.","Fuente: MCD64A1 por cobertura del suelo, GWIS.","Source : MCD64A1 par couverture du sol, GWIS.","Sumber: MCD64A1 menurut tutupan lahan, GWIS.","来源：按土地覆盖划分的 MCD64A1，GWIS。"],"Sazonalidade":["Seasonality","Estacionalidad","Saisonnalité","Musiman","季节性"],"Série anual":["Annual series","Serie anual","Série annuelle","Seri tahunan","年度序列"],"Fonte: área queimada MCD64A1 e emissões GFED, ambas via GWIS.":["Source: MCD64A1 burned area and GFED emissions, both via GWIS.","Fuente: área quemada MCD64A1 y emisiones GFED, ambas a través de GWIS.","Source : surface brûlée MCD64A1 et émissions GFED, les deux via GWIS.","Sumber: area terbakar MCD64A1 dan emisi GFED, keduanya melalui GWIS.","来源：MCD64A1 烧毁面积和 GFED 排放量，均通过 GWIS。"],"Tabela completa do período":["Full table for the period","Tabla completa del período","Tableau complet de la période","Tabel lengkap untuk periode ini","该期间完整数据表"],"Todas as unidades do recorte, todos os indicadores.":["All units in the selection, all indicators.","Todas las unidades de la selección, todos los indicadores.","Toutes les unités de la sélection, tous les indicateurs.","Semua unit pada pilihan, semua indikator.","选取范围内的所有单位，所有指标。"],"Fontes":["Sources","Fuentes","Sources","Sumber","来源"],"Dado original":["Original data","Dato original","Donnée originale","Data asli","原始数据"],"Quem agregou":["Aggregator","Quién agregó","Qui a agrégé","Agregator","数据整合方"],"Período":["Period","Período","Période","Periode","期间"],"MODIS MCD64A1 (NASA), 500 m":["MODIS MCD64A1 (NASA), 500 m","MODIS MCD64A1 (NASA), 500 m","MODIS MCD64A1 (NASA), 500 m","MODIS MCD64A1 (NASA), 500 m","MODIS MCD64A1 (NASA), 500 m"],"GWIS country profile":["GWIS country profile","GWIS country profile","GWIS country profile","GWIS country profile","GWIS country profile"],"(JRC / Copernicus), por país, estado (GADM nível 1) e cobertura":["(JRC / Copernicus), by country, state (GADM level 1) and land cover","(JRC / Copernicus), por país, estado (GADM nivel 1) y cobertura","(JRC / Copernicus), par pays, État (GADM niveau 1) et couverture","(JRC / Copernicus), menurut negara, negara bagian (GADM level 1), dan tutupan lahan","(JRC / Copernicus)，按国家、州 (GADM 1 级) 和土地覆盖划分"],"Área queimada VIIRS":["VIIRS burned area","Área quemada VIIRS","Surface brûlée VIIRS","Area terbakar VIIRS","VIIRS 烧毁面积"],"VNP64 / VIIRS, 375 m":["VNP64 / VIIRS, 375 m","VNP64 / VIIRS, 375 m","VNP64 / VIIRS, 375 m","VNP64 / VIIRS, 375 m","VNP64 / VIIRS, 375 m"],"GWIS":["GWIS","GWIS","GWIS","GWIS","GWIS"],"Emissões (CO₂, CH₄, PM2.5)":["Emissions (CO₂, CH₄, PM2.5)","Emisiones (CO₂, CH₄, PM2.5)","Émissions (CO₂, CH₄, PM2.5)","Emisi (CO₂, CH₄, PM2.5)","排放量 (CO₂, CH₄, PM2.5)"],"GFED":["GFED","GFED","GFED","GFED","GFED"],"NASA FIRMS (MODIS, 1 km)":["NASA FIRMS (MODIS, 1 km)","NASA FIRMS (MODIS, 1 km)","NASA FIRMS (MODIS, 1 km)","NASA FIRMS (MODIS, 1 km)","NASA FIRMS (MODIS, 1 km)"],"Este painel, no Google Earth Engine":["This dashboard, in Google Earth Engine","Este panel, en Google Earth Engine","Ce tableau de bord, dans Google Earth Engine","Dasbor ini, di Google Earth Engine","此仪表板，位于 Google Earth Engine"],"Área queimada recente":["Recent burned area","Área quemada reciente","Surface brûlée récente","Area terbakar terkini","近期烧毁面积"],"MODIS MCD64A1":["MODIS MCD64A1","MODIS MCD64A1","MODIS MCD64A1","MODIS MCD64A1","MODIS MCD64A1"],"Este painel, no Google Earth Engine (preliminar)":["This dashboard, in Google Earth Engine (preliminary)","Este panel, en Google Earth Engine (preliminar)","Ce tableau de bord, dans Google Earth Engine (préliminaire)","Dasbor ini, di Google Earth Engine (awal)","此仪表板，位于 Google Earth Engine (初步)"],"após o fim do GWIS":["after GWIS end","después del fin de GWIS","après la fin de GWIS","setelah periode GWIS","在 GWIS 结束之后"],"Focos de calor = soma, no mês, dos pixels com fogo ativo em cada dia (pixels-dia). Não é o mesmo número dos boletins de “focos” de outros satélites, mas segue a mesma dinâmica.":["Active fires (hotspots) = monthly sum of pixels with active fire each day (pixel-days). It is not the same number as \"hotspot\" reports from other satellites, but follows the same dynamics.","Focos de calor = suma, en el mes, de los píxeles con fuego activo cada día (píxeles-día). No es el mismo número de los boletines de \"focos\" de otros satélites, pero sigue la misma dinámica.","Feux actifs (points chauds) = somme, dans le mois, des pixels avec feu actif chaque jour (pixels-jour). Ce n'est pas le même nombre que les bulletins de « points chauds » d'autres satellites, mais suit la même dynamique.","Titik api (hotspot) = jumlah bulanan piksel dengan api aktif setiap hari (piksel-hari). Angkanya tidak sama dengan laporan \"hotspot\" dari satelit lain, tetapi mengikuti dinamika yang sama.","火点 (hotspots) = 本月每天存在活跃火灾的像素总和 (像素-天)。这与其他卫星报告的“火点”数量不同，但动态趋势相同。"],"Continentes e mapas":["Continents and maps","Continentes y mapas","Continents et cartes","Benua dan peta","大洲和地图"],"Continentes seguem o Natural Earth (a Rússia entra na Europa; América Central e Caribe em “América do Norte e Central”). O mapa de países usa Natural Earth 1:110m. O mapa de estados usa limites geoBoundaries ADM1 simplificados, casados por nome com as unidades GADM do GWIS. Unidades sem par aparecem em cinza.":["Continents follow Natural Earth (Russia is in Europe; Central America and Caribbean in \"North and Central America\"). The countries map uses Natural Earth 1:110m. The states map uses simplified geoBoundaries ADM1 limits, matched by name with GWIS GADM units. Unmatched units appear in gray.","Los continentes siguen Natural Earth (Rusia entra en Europa; América Central y el Caribe en \"América del Norte y Central\"). El mapa de países usa Natural Earth 1:110m. El mapa de estados usa límites geoBoundaries ADM1 simplificados, emparejados por nombre con las unidades GADM de GWIS. Las unidades sin par aparecen en gris.","Les continents suivent Natural Earth (la Russie est en Europe ; l'Amérique centrale et les Caraïbes dans « Amérique du Nord et centrale »). La carte des pays utilise Natural Earth 1:110m. La carte des États utilise des limites geoBoundaries ADM1 simplifiées, associées par nom aux unités GADM du GWIS. Les unités sans correspondance apparaissent en gris.","Benua mengikuti Natural Earth (Rusia masuk Eropa; Amerika Tengah dan Karibia masuk \"Amerika Utara dan Tengah\"). Peta negara menggunakan Natural Earth 1:110m. Peta negara bagian menggunakan batas geoBoundaries ADM1 yang disederhanakan, disesuaikan namanya dengan unit GADM dari GWIS. Unit yang tidak cocok berwarna abu-abu.","大洲遵循 Natural Earth 标准 (俄罗斯归入欧洲；中美洲和加勒比海归入“北美和中美洲”)。国家地图使用 Natural Earth 1:110m。州地图使用简化的 geoBoundaries ADM1 边界，按名称与 GWIS 的 GADM 单位匹配。未匹配的单位显示为灰色。"],"Leitura":["Reading","Lectura","Lecture","Membaca","解读"],"As setas do ranking mostram a mudança de posição em relação ao período anterior (mês anterior, ou ano anterior quando “Ano todo”).":["Ranking arrows show the position change compared to the previous period (previous month, or previous year when \"Full year\").","Las flechas del ranking muestran el cambio de posición respecto al período anterior (mes anterior, o año anterior en \"Año completo\").","Les flèches du classement montrent le changement de position par rapport à la période précédente (mois précédent, ou année précédente pour « Année complète »).","Panah peringkat menunjukkan perubahan posisi dibandingkan periode sebelumnya (bulan sebelumnya, atau tahun sebelumnya saat \"Sepanjang tahun\").","排名箭头显示了与上一期间 (上个月，或选择“全年”时的上一年) 相比的位置变化。"],"% do território":["% of territory","% del territorio","% du territoire","% dari wilayah","领土百分比"],"só existe para países e continentes.":["only exists for countries and continents.","solo existe para países y continentes.","n'existe que pour les pays et les continents.","hanya berlaku untuk negara dan benua.","仅存在于国家和大洲。"],"MCD64A1 subestima queimadas pequenas (< ~25 ha) e de sub-bosque; VIIRS (375 m) costuma detectar mais. Use para comparar unidades e meses, não como total absoluto.":["MCD64A1 underestimates small fires (< ~25 ha) and understory fires; VIIRS (375 m) usually detects more. Use to compare units and months, not as an absolute total.","MCD64A1 subestima fuegos pequeños (< ~25 ha) y de sotobosque; VIIRS (375 m) suele detectar más. Úselo para comparar unidades y meses, no como total absoluto.","MCD64A1 sous-estime les petits incendies (< ~25 ha) et de sous-bois ; VIIRS (375 m) en détecte généralement plus. Utilisez pour comparer unités et mois, non comme total absolu.","MCD64A1 meremehkan kebakaran kecil (< ~25 ha) dan kebakaran bawah tajuk; VIIRS (375 m) biasanya mendeteksi lebih banyak. Gunakan untuk membandingkan unit dan bulan, bukan sebagai total mutlak.","MCD64A1 低估了小型火灾 (< ~25 公顷) 和林下火灾；VIIRS (375 米) 通常能检测到更多。用于比较不同单位和月份，而非作为绝对总数。"],"Reprodução":["Reproduction","Reproducción","Reproduction","Reproduksi","复现"],"Código em":["Code at","Código en","Code dans","Kode di","代码见"],"global_analises/scripts/":["global_analises/scripts/","global_analises/scripts/","global_analises/scripts/","global_analises/scripts/","global_analises/scripts/"],"do repositório":["of the repository","del repositorio","du dépôt","dari repositori","，位于代码库"],"mapbiomas/brazil-fire":["mapbiomas/brazil-fire","mapbiomas/brazil-fire","mapbiomas/brazil-fire","mapbiomas/brazil-fire","mapbiomas/brazil-fire"],"MCD64A1 via GWIS":["MCD64A1 via GWIS","MCD64A1 a través de GWIS","MCD64A1 via GWIS","MCD64A1 melalui GWIS","MCD64A1 通过 GWIS"],"Área VIIRS":["VIIRS area","Área VIIRS","Surface VIIRS","Area VIIRS","VIIRS 面积"],"VNP64 via GWIS":["VNP64 via GWIS","VNP64 a través de GWIS","VNP64 via GWIS","VNP64 melalui GWIS","VNP64 通过 GWIS"],"FIRMS via GEE